            "detailed_description": "<i>Super Markup Man</i> is a unique blend of puzzle platforming and real web development education. Learn the fundamentals of HTML and CSS in a hands-on, no-code environment where every level challenges your logic and creativity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>🧠 100 handcrafted levels combining web dev learning with puzzle-solving<br><br>🔤 HTML Mode that covers basic tags like &lt;a&gt;, &lt;img&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;, and more<br><br>🎨 CSS Mode to style elements with selectors, colors, and layouts<br><br>🧪 Bug mode to add random errors that must be squashed<br><br>🕹️ Local co-op mode to learn with a friend*<br><br>💾 Free Play Mode to export your levels as real HTML files<br><br>👪 Family-friendly and beginner-friendly, perfect for classrooms or home<br><br><i>* Note: Only Free Play and CSS Mode support local co-op. Player 2 will also need to use a gamepad (Xbox gamepad recommended).</i>",
            "about_the_game": "<i>Super Markup Man</i> is a unique blend of puzzle platforming and real web development education. Learn the fundamentals of HTML and CSS in a hands-on, no-code environment where every level challenges your logic and creativity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>🧠 100 handcrafted levels combining web dev learning with puzzle-solving<br><br>🔤 HTML Mode that covers basic tags like &lt;a&gt;, &lt;img&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;, and more<br><br>🎨 CSS Mode to style elements with selectors, colors, and layouts<br><br>🧪 Bug mode to add random errors that must be squashed<br><br>🕹️ Local co-op mode to learn with a friend*<br><br>💾 Free Play Mode to export your levels as real HTML files<br><br>👪 Family-friendly and beginner-friendly, perfect for classrooms or home<br><br><i>* Note: Only Free Play and CSS Mode support local co-op. Player 2 will also need to use a gamepad (Xbox gamepad recommended).</i>",
            "short_description": "Learn HTML and CSS through a 2D puzzle platformer! Carry and place real web tags, solve logic-based levels, and build your own web page templates. No coding needed!",
